 "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc15syh.jpg"}], "slug": "conquest-of-the-realms", "storyline": "The moon has shattered. Its broken face hangs over five realms, each held by its\nown people: the Humans of snowbound Frostvale, the Elves of verdant Southreach,\nthe Orcs of volcanic Dreadholm, the Goblins of the desert Sunara and the Trolls\nof twilight Valemoor. Between them lies the Nexus of the Shattered Moon, a\ndrifting ruin where the realms' portals meet and the floating remains of older\ntemples hang in the sky. Beneath them all stirs the Void.\n\nEach realm sends its Heroes out to claim Keeps, raise their Towns and push their\nbanners into the Nexus Battle Grounds \u00e2\u20ac\u201d because when the realms go to war, no\nHero fights alone.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/conquest-of-the-realms", "videos": [{"id": 199211, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "IDDJWppM16Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IDDJWppM16Q", "title": "Conquest of the Realms Intro Cinematic", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IDDJWppM16Q/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}